OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786015090
OL,3,C16-year-old found guilty of murdering
OL,4,CSussex teenager over #20 drug debt
OL,6,FA teenager has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurdering a 16-year-old boy at a
OL,8,Fseaside town train station over a #20
OL,9,Fdrug debt.
OL,11,FThe teenager, who is also 16-years-old
OL,12,Fand cannot be named for legal reasons,
OL,13,Fwas convicted by jurors at Hove Crown
OL,14,FCourt, after he stabbed Joshua Ingram
OL,15,Fin Seaford, East Sussex, on September
OL,16,F10 2025.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/9
