PN,38702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786015090
OL,3,C16-year-old found guilty of murdering
OL,4,CSussex teenager over #20 drug debt
OL,6,FThe youth defendant was on trial
OL,7,Falongside two other boys, aged 17 and
OL,8,F15, accused of conspiracy to cause
OL,9,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent in
OL,10,Fthe lead up to the attack between June
OL,11,F1 and September 11.
OL,13,FJurors found all three of them not
OL,14,Fguilty of that charge.
OL,16,FThe 15-year-old was found guilty of
OL,17,Fassisting an offender on the day of
OL,18,Fthe murder; the 17-year-old had
OL,19,Falready pleaded guilty to the same
OL,20,Fcharge.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
