OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786015090
OL,3,C16-year-old found guilty of murdering
OL,4,CSussex teenager over #20 drug debt
OL,6,FThe prosecution had told jurors that
OL,7,Fthe 16-year-old defendant was a "small-
OL,8,Ftime drug dealer" who had supplied
OL,9,FJoshua with drugs in the summer of
OL,10,F2025 but had not been paid for them.
OL,12,FSnapchat messages read in court
OL,13,Fincluded the teenager now convicted of
OL,14,Fmurder saying: "Josh will perish if I
OL,15,Fdon't get my f****** money, that's a
OL,16,Ffact and he knows this.
OL,18,F"I'm ready to sit in a prison cell for
OL,19,F30 years over a #20 sheet."
OL,26,@oD@aOUpD@QO]vD@POUzD@AOU{D@[O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/9
