OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786015090
OL,3,C16-year-old found guilty of murdering
OL,4,CSussex teenager over #20 drug debt
OL,6,FProsecutor Rossano Scamardella KC said
OL,7,Fthe 16-year-old went to Seaford on the
OL,8,Fday of the attack with a 19cm-long
OL,9,Fknife hidden in his tracksuit bottoms
OL,10,Fwhen he approached Joshua, who was
OL,11,Ffrom Newhaven, and stabbed him twice.
OL,13,FThe prosecutor said: "Joshua stood no
OL,14,Fchance. The speed of the attack from
OL,15,Fbehind gave him no chance to defend
OL,16,Fhimself and the injury he sustained
OL,17,Fwas so serious that he could not
OL,18,Fsurvive.
OL,26,@uD@VOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
