OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786015090
OL,3,C16-year-old found guilty of murdering
OL,4,CSussex teenager over #20 drug debt
OL,6,F"He collapsed on the station platform
OL,7,Fand despite the very best attempts by
OL,8,Fmembers of the public and emergency
OL,9,Fworkers, he died within an hour of
OL,10,Fbeing stabbed and even before he could
OL,11,Fbe taken to hospital."
OL,13,FHe added: "All of this over a #20
OL,14,Fcannabis debt."
OL,16,FThe 16-year-old had pleaded guilty to
OL,17,Fmanslaughter and giving evidence
OL,18,Fduring the trial he said it was a
OL,19,F"tragic and reckless moment".
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@VO]uD@KOUvD@OO]{D@AOU{D@\O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/9
