PN,38706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786015090
OL,3,C16-year-old found guilty of murdering
OL,4,CSussex teenager over #20 drug debt
OL,6,FThe boy told jurors he viewed the 19cm
OL,7,Fknife as an "accessory" which he had
OL,8,Fbought on Telegram but "didn't look at
OL,9,Fit for what it actually was" and never
OL,10,Fintended to kill or seriously harm
OL,11,FJoshua.
OL,13,FThe court had also heard in evidence
OL,14,Fthe teenager had the knife used to
OL,15,Fkill Joshua since he was in year 9 and
OL,16,Fwould "wave it around and playfully
OL,17,Fintimidate" with it at his house.
OL,19,FIn the fatal attack in September, the
OL,20,Fblade travelled 15cm into Joshua's
OL,21,Fbody.
OL,26,@oD@MOUoD@WO]pD@XOUqD@\O]xD@GOUyD@KO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/9
