PN,38707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786015090
OL,3,C16-year-old found guilty of murdering
OL,4,CSussex teenager over #20 drug debt
OL,6,FGiving evidence in the trial, Joshua's
OL,7,Ffriend who was with him when he got
OL,8,Fstabbed, said he saw the attacker
OL,9,F"with no hesitation" taking the knife
OL,10,Fout and stabbing Joshua twice.
OL,12,FThe friend said the defendant asked:
OL,13,F"Is that Josh?" before he stepped
OL,14,Fahead of him, pulled a knife from his
OL,15,Fright hip and "went for it twice" and
OL,16,Fran.
OL,18,FHe said: "He had no hesitation ` he
OL,19,Fhad a very still facial expression, he
OL,20,Fwasn't pulling a face, he didn't look
OL,21,Flike he had anger in him.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@TO]uD@AOUuD@OO]wD@OOUwD@aO]zD@
OL,26,AJOU
