PN,38708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786015090
OL,3,C16-year-old found guilty of murdering
OL,4,CSussex teenager over #20 drug debt
OL,6,F"He looked very calm and just normal,
OL,7,Fbut then just did that.
OL,9,F"I don't think Josh even knew what had
OL,10,Fhappened."
OL,12,FThe friend described how Joshua walked
OL,13,Fa couple of steps and then "dropped to
OL,14,Fthe floor" as he tried to call 999.
OL,16,FIn a tribute released by the family of
OL,17,FJoshua after his death, they described
OL,18,Fhim as a "cheeky chappie who was loved
OL,19,Fby many" and who was taken "far too
OL,20,Fsoon".
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@AOUrD@JO]uD@\OUvD@JO]zD@JOU{D@
OL,26,AHO]{D@\OU|D@EO]
